  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pol 206.15 Ex Parte Communications. Ex parte communications of any kind during the pendency of the proceeding shall be prohibited except as provided in RSA 541-A:36 and Pol 202.02.\n\nSource. #7302, eff 6-8-00; ss by #9167, INTERIM, eff 6-3-08, EXPIRES: 11-30-08; ss and moved by #9223-A, eff 8-1-08 (from Pol 206.14)",
